   ],
   "answer": "You create an installment plan when both of the following apply: [S1]\n- There are one or more open items on the contract account of a business partner. [S1]\nTo do this, under: Business Transactions > Deferral and Installment Plan > Define Categories for Installment Plan , specify a percentage and activate the enhancement under Business Transactions > Deferral and Installment Plan > Activate Installment Plan Enhancement for Surcharges/Interest . [S2]\n- Create or delete an installment plan surcharge and/or an inflation surcharge The prerequisite in this case is that you activated the enhancement in Customizing under Business Transactions > Deferral and Installment Plans > Activate Installment Plan Enhancement for Charges/Interest . [S4]",
